{{#is_alert}}
IRIS instance {{host.name}} is using {{value}} percent of system CPU. At this level the instance queues work instead of running it, so query and message latency will degrade. Check for runaway jobs or an undersized host.
{{/is_alert}}

{{#is_warning}}
IRIS instance {{host.name}} is using {{value}} percent of system CPU. It has not yet crossed the critical threshold, but processing headroom is shrinking.
{{/is_warning}}

{{#is_recovery}}
CPU usage on IRIS instance {{host.name}} has dropped back to a healthy level and the instance has processing headroom again.
{{/is_recovery}}
